- Stage 0: `gcc cc0.c -o ccc0`
- Stage 1: `./ccc0 cc0.c -o ccc1`
- Stage 2: `./ccc1 cc0.c -o ccc2`
- 검증: `cmp ccc1 ccc2` (고정점)

